<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-AUCKLAND SNATCH LUCKY WIN.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUCKLAND SNATCH LUCKY WIN.</headline>
<dateline>PUKAKOHE, New Zealand 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Auckland Blues joined Gauteng Lions (formerly Transvaal) at the top of the Super 12 rugby table on Friday when they snatched a fortunate 29-28 victory over Canterbury Crusaders at Pukakohe Stadium.</p>
</text>
